{"page":221,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"214","words":[{"text":"214","x":199,"y":134,"width":78,"height":34}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":586,"y":137,"width":124,"height":25},{"text":"03","x":722,"y":138,"width":32,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":788,"y":144,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":832,"y":138,"width":130,"height":27},{"text":"계층","x":974,"y":138,"width":51,"height":29}]},{"text":"지하지 않는다. 사실. 중간 라우터들은 전혀 TCP 연결을 감지하지 못한다. 즉, 이뇨인","words":[{"text":"지하지","x":562,"y":262,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"않는다.","x":677,"y":262,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"사실.","x":800,"y":261,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"중간","x":890,"y":262,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"라우터들은","x":971,"y":262,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"전혀","x":1153,"y":262,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":1230,"y":266,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"연결을","x":1317,"y":261,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"감지하지","x":1432,"y":261,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"못한다.","x":1583,"y":262,"width":113,"height":36},{"text":"즉,","x":1713,"y":263,"width":43,"height":35},{"text":"이뇨인","x":1773,"y":261,"width":96,"height":43}]},{"text":"연결은 보지 못하고 데이터그램만을 본다.","words":[{"text":"연결은","x":562,"y":320,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"보지","x":673,"y":320,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"못하고","x":752,"y":320,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"데이터그램만을","x":866,"y":319,"width":234,"height":38},{"text":"본다.","x":1112,"y":320,"width":74,"height":37}]},{"text":"TCP 연결은 전이중(full-duplex) 서비스를 제공한다. 만약 한 호스트 A의 프로세","words":[{"text":"TCP","x":623,"y":384,"width":72,"height":28},{"text":"연결은","x":710,"y":379,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"전이중(full-duplex)","x":823,"y":378,"width":302,"height":41},{"text":"서비스를","x":1141,"y":379,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1288,"y":379,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"만약","x":1447,"y":379,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":1528,"y":379,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"호스트","x":1577,"y":382,"width":105,"height":29},{"text":"A의","x":1695,"y":379,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"프로세","x":1772,"y":382,"width":93,"height":40}]},{"text":"스와 다른 호스트 B의 프로세스 사이에 TCP 연결이 있다면, 애플리케이션 계층 데이","words":[{"text":"스와","x":556,"y":437,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":639,"y":438,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":720,"y":440,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"B의","x":835,"y":438,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스","x":908,"y":439,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"사이에","x":1056,"y":438,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":1169,"y":443,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"연결이","x":1257,"y":438,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"있다면,","x":1373,"y":438,"width":109,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":1500,"y":438,"width":206,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":1724,"y":437,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"데이","x":1807,"y":440,"width":57,"height":40}]},{"text":"터는 B에서 A로 흐르는 동시에 A에서 B로 흐를 수 있다. 또한 TCP 연결은 항상 단일","words":[{"text":"터는","x":557,"y":496,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"B에서","x":636,"y":497,"width":89,"height":37},{"text":"A로","x":741,"y":500,"width":61,"height":29},{"text":"흐르는","x":815,"y":498,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"동시에","x":928,"y":496,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"A에서","x":1041,"y":497,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"B로","x":1149,"y":501,"width":58,"height":28},{"text":"흐를","x":1220,"y":499,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1299,"y":497,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1349,"y":497,"width":74,"height":36},{"text":"또한","x":1439,"y":496,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"TCP","x":1519,"y":501,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"연결은","x":1609,"y":497,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"항상","x":1724,"y":496,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"단일","x":1805,"y":498,"width":60,"height":39}]},{"text":"송신자와 단일 수신자 사이의 점대점(point-to-point)이다. 단일 송신 동작으로 한 송","words":[{"text":"송신자와","x":553,"y":555,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"단일","x":704,"y":555,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"수신자","x":784,"y":555,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"사이의","x":901,"y":555,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"점대점(point-to-point)이다.","x":1017,"y":555,"width":434,"height":40},{"text":"단일","x":1469,"y":556,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"송신","x":1552,"y":556,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"동작으로","x":1637,"y":555,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1791,"y":555,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"송","x":1837,"y":559,"width":30,"height":36}]},{"text":"신자가 여러 수신자에게 데이터를 전송하는 “멀티개스팅”(온라인 보조자료를 참조)은","words":[{"text":"신자가","x":554,"y":614,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"여러","x":670,"y":614,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"수신자에게","x":750,"y":614,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":936,"y":614,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"전송하는","x":1085,"y":614,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"“멀티개스팅”(온라인","x":1234,"y":614,"width":316,"height":40},{"text":"보조자료를","x":1568,"y":615,"width":174,"height":36},{"text":"참조)은","x":1758,"y":613,"width":110,"height":41}]},{"text":"TCP에서는 불가능하다. TCP에서는 두 호스트는 동료이고 셋은 군중이다!","words":[{"text":"TCP에서는","x":551,"y":673,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"불가능하다.","x":735,"y":673,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"TCP에서는","x":926,"y":673,"width":173,"height":36},{"text":"두","x":1111,"y":675,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"호스트는","x":1157,"y":675,"width":137,"height":34},{"text":"동료이고","x":1306,"y":675,"width":138,"height":36},{"text":"셋은","x":1458,"y":675,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"군중이다!","x":1539,"y":674,"width":149,"height":37}]},{"text":"이제 TCP “연결”이 어떻게 설정되는지 살펴보자. 한 호스트에서 동작하는 프로세","words":[{"text":"이제","x":618,"y":732,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"TCP","x":696,"y":736,"width":71,"height":28},{"text":"“연결”이","x":781,"y":731,"width":125,"height":37},{"text":"어떻게","x":925,"y":732,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"설정되는지","x":1038,"y":732,"width":165,"height":36},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":1221,"y":732,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1381,"y":734,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"호스트에서","x":1430,"y":734,"width":169,"height":35},{"text":"동작하는","x":1616,"y":732,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"프로세","x":1771,"y":735,"width":94,"height":37}]},{"text":"스가 다른 호스트의 프로세스와 연결을 초기화하기를 원한다고 가정하자. 연결을 초기","words":[{"text":"스가","x":550,"y":792,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"다른","x":631,"y":791,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"호스트의","x":709,"y":791,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"프로세스와","x":857,"y":791,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"연결을","x":1042,"y":791,"width":100,"height":36},{"text":"초기화하기를","x":1154,"y":791,"width":206,"height":38},{"text":"원한다고","x":1375,"y":793,"width":137,"height":36},{"text":"가정하자.","x":1526,"y":792,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"연결을","x":1691,"y":790,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"초기","x":1806,"y":793,"width":57,"height":39}]},{"text":"화하는 프로세스를 클라이언트 프로세스, 다른 프로세스를 서버 프로세스라고 부른다고","words":[{"text":"화하는","x":549,"y":851,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스를","x":663,"y":850,"width":170,"height":36},{"text":"클라이언트","x":847,"y":852,"width":159,"height":34},{"text":"프로세스,","x":1019,"y":853,"width":135,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":1171,"y":851,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스를","x":1254,"y":852,"width":173,"height":36},{"text":"서버","x":1442,"y":854,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"프로세스라고","x":1519,"y":851,"width":202,"height":37},{"text":"부른다고","x":1736,"y":850,"width":131,"height":38}]},{"text":"했다. 클라이언트 애플리케이션 프로세스는 서버의 프로세스와 연결을 설정하기를 원","words":[{"text":"했다.","x":549,"y":911,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트","x":638,"y":909,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":823,"y":910,"width":202,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스는","x":1040,"y":910,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"서버의","x":1227,"y":910,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스와","x":1343,"y":911,"width":175,"height":37},{"text":"연결을","x":1534,"y":911,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"설정하기를","x":1653,"y":910,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"원","x":1839,"y":914,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"한다고 TCP 클라이언트에게 먼저 알린다. 2.7.2절에서 파이썬 클라이언트 프로그램이","words":[{"text":"한다고","x":546,"y":970,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":658,"y":974,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"클라이언트에게","x":742,"y":970,"width":236,"height":37},{"text":"먼저","x":997,"y":970,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"알린다.","x":1076,"y":970,"width":108,"height":36},{"text":"2.7.2절에서","x":1200,"y":970,"width":178,"height":38},{"text":"파이썬","x":1395,"y":970,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트","x":1512,"y":971,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램이","x":1701,"y":972,"width":164,"height":40}]},{"text":"다음 명령을 이용하여 이 기능을 수행했음을 떠올리자.","words":[{"text":"다음","x":545,"y":1031,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"명령을","x":626,"y":1030,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"이용하여","x":741,"y":1031,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":889,"y":1030,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"기능을","x":935,"y":1030,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"수행했음을","x":1047,"y":1030,"width":172,"height":37},{"text":"떠올리자.","x":1233,"y":1030,"width":142,"height":38}]},{"text":"c1ientSocket . connect ( ( serverName , serverPort) )","words":[{"text":"c1ientSocket","x":544,"y":1130,"width":277,"height":29},{"text":".","x":832,"y":1152,"width":7,"height":6},{"text":"connect","x":850,"y":1132,"width":158,"height":25},{"text":"(","x":1022,"y":1129,"width":7,"height":30},{"text":"(","x":1045,"y":1129,"width":7,"height":30},{"text":"serverName","x":1061,"y":1132,"width":230,"height":25},{"text":",","x":1301,"y":1151,"width":6,"height":11},{"text":"serverPort)","x":1320,"y":1129,"width":250,"height":31},{"text":")","x":1586,"y":1129,"width":8,"height":31}]},{"text":"앞 프로그램 명령에서 serverName은 서버 이름이고, serverPort는 서버의 프","words":[{"text":"앞","x":542,"y":1220,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램","x":591,"y":1221,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"명령에서","x":747,"y":1220,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"serverName은","x":898,"y":1220,"width":267,"height":35},{"text":"서버","x":1181,"y":1218,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"이름이고,","x":1265,"y":1218,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"serverPort는","x":1429,"y":1221,"width":277,"height":34},{"text":"서버의","x":1723,"y":1218,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"프","x":1838,"y":1225,"width":30,"height":27}]},{"text":"로세스를 구별한다. 클라이언트의 트랜스포트 계층은 서버의 TCP와의 TCP 연결 설","words":[{"text":"로세스를","x":540,"y":1281,"width":139,"height":36},{"text":"구별한다.","x":694,"y":1281,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트의","x":856,"y":1279,"width":201,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1076,"y":1280,"width":171,"height":35},{"text":"계층은","x":1265,"y":1278,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"서버의","x":1384,"y":1278,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"TCP와의","x":1503,"y":1278,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":1664,"y":1283,"width":76,"height":28},{"text":"연결","x":1759,"y":1278,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"설","x":1840,"y":1282,"width":26,"height":35}]},{"text":"정을 진행한다. 이 절의 마지막에서 연결 설정 절치를 자세하게 설명할 것이다. 지금은","words":[{"text":"정을","x":543,"y":1341,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"진행한다.","x":624,"y":1341,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":784,"y":1342,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"절의","x":830,"y":1341,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"마지막에서","x":909,"y":1339,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"연결","x":1094,"y":1339,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"설정","x":1173,"y":1339,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"절치를","x":1254,"y":1338,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"자세하게","x":1370,"y":1338,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"설명할","x":1523,"y":1338,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1644,"y":1338,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"지금은","x":1774,"y":1338,"width":95,"height":39}]},{"text":"클라이언트가 먼저 특별한 TCP 세그먼트를 보낸다는 것을 아는 것으로 충분하다. 서","words":[{"text":"클라이언트가","x":540,"y":1401,"width":206,"height":38},{"text":"먼저","x":763,"y":1401,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"특별한","x":842,"y":1400,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":958,"y":1405,"width":72,"height":28},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":1045,"y":1399,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"보낸다는","x":1230,"y":1398,"width":138,"height":36},{"text":"것을","x":1385,"y":1398,"width":68,"height":36},{"text":"아는","x":1468,"y":1398,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"것으로","x":1555,"y":1398,"width":105,"height"